00:11:52,504 --> 00:11:55,593
useful when software distributes work correctly. But

275
00:11:55,593 --> 00:11:57,312
they're not one giant card, and they're

276
00:11:57,312 --> 00:11:59,640
certainly not an automatic doubling of speed.

277
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,346
So before buying the second GPU, finish this

278
